000;stroke-width:1;" x1="1515.4551" x2="1509.4551" y1="1251.9673" y2="1251.9673"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="14" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="227.7051" x="1272.75" y="1268.0425">Digest-bound redacted evidence</text></g><g class="entity" data-qualified-name="GMN33" data-source-line="44" id="ent0034"><path d="M2462.84,1216.4673 L2462.84,1305.4639 L2858.3644,1305.4639 L2858.3644,1226.4673 L2848.3644,1216.4673 L2462.84,1216.4673" fill="#FFFFFF" style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;"/><path d="M2848.3644,1216.4673 L2848.3644,1226.4673 L2858.3644,1226.4673 L2848.3644,1216.4673" fill="#FFFFFF" style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="13" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="290.5005" x="2468.84" y="1234.5371">No protected environment, signing material,</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="13" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="307.2583" x="2468.84" y="1250.3364">publication token, privileged runner, or trusted</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="13" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="320.3218" x="2468.84" y="1266.1358">release cache/artifact is reachable from PR code.</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="13" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="355.5894" x="2468.84" y="1281.9351">All macOS-path blocking checks run on GitHub-hosted</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="Verdana" font-size="13" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="374.5244" x="2468.84" y="1297.7344">macOS; optional relay-native Linux evidence is separate.</text></g><g class="entity" data-qualified-name="GMN36" data-source-line="52" id="ent0037"><path d="M726.04,893.7473 L726.04,951.1453 A0,0 0 0 0 726.04,951.1453 L1099.1572,951.1453 A0,0 0 0 0 1099.1572,951.1453 L1099.1572,903.7473 L1089.1572,893.7473 L949.32,893.7473 L1046.7,806.8073 L941.32,893.7473 L726.04,893.7473 A0,0 0 0 0 726.04,893.7473" fill="#FFFFFF" style="stroke:#000000;stroke-width:1;"/><path d="M